<title>USA: Prudential wins Georgetown ISD, Texas, $34 mln.</title>
<headline>Prudential wins Georgetown ISD, Texas, $34 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc said Tuesday it won a $34 million Georgetown Independent School District, Texas, school building unlimited tax bond issue, Series 1996.</p>
